---
title: Francisco Giraldo - Backend Engineer
description: Backend engineer designing distributed systems with TypeScript, NestJS, Kubernetes, and cloud hosting on GCP and AWS.
layout: layout.njk
js: ["plugins/tiny-slider/tiny-slider.js", "js/testimonials.js"]
css: ["plugins/tiny-slider/tiny-slider.css"]
---

<section class="about-me-section p-3 p-lg-5 theme-bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="profile-teaser media flex-column flex-lg-row">
            
            <div class="media-body">
                <h2 class="name font-weight-bold mb-1">Francisco Giraldo</h2>
                <div class="tagline mb-3">Senior Backend Engineer</div>
                <div class="bio mb-4">I design backend distributed systems: services, messaging, and the platform that runs them. The stack is TypeScript and NestJS, delivered with Docker, Kubernetes, Helm, and Argo CD, on GCP and AWS. I write about that work on <a class="link-on-bg" href="/blog">my blog</a>. The detail is on my <a class="link-on-bg" href="/resume">resume</a>.
                </div><!--//bio-->
                <div class="mb-4">
                    <a class="btn btn-primary mr-2 mb-3" href="/resume"><i class="fas fa-file-alt mr-2"></i><span class="d-none d-md-inline">View</span> Resume</a>
                    <a class="btn btn-secondary mb-3" href="/blog"><i class="fas fa-blog mr-2"></i><span class="d-none d-md-inline">View</span> Blog</a>
                </div>
            </div><!--//media-body-->
            <img class="profile-image mb-3 mb-lg-0 ml-lg-5 mr-md-0" src="/assets/images/Francisco Giraldo.jpg" alt="Francisco Giraldo">
        </div>
    </div>
</section><!--//about-me-section-->

<section class="overview-section p-3 p-lg-5">
    <div class="container">

        <h2 class="section-title font-weight-bold mb-3">Technical Experience</h2>

